    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waddle fast. Jump high. Save your eggs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil walruses have stolen your precious eggs\u2014and Mama Penguin isn\u2019t having it. Dash, dive, and double-jump your way through 17 action-packed levels in <i>Penguin Panic</i>, a charming retro-style platformer full of surprises, secret challenges, and slippery foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Penguin Adventure </i>on the MSX, <i>Penguin Panic</i> brings retro 2D platformer fun with modern polish. Whether you're bouncing off walrus heads, collecting tasty fish, or racing against the clock, every level is a colorful, fast-paced adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 hand-crafted levels across icy tundras, grassy fields, scorching deserts, and snowy peaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls, satisfying platforming, and loads of hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No violence, no ads\u2014just pure, penguin-powered fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for kids, nostalgic grownups, and anyone who says \u201cnoot noot\u201d unironically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by the award-winning creators of <i>Avalon</i> and <i>Online Soccer Manager (OSM)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to outwit the walruses and save your family? Slide into action and find out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waddle fast. Jump high. Save your eggs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil walruses have stolen your precious eggs\u2014and Mama Penguin isn\u2019t having it. Dash, dive, and double-jump your way through 17 action-packed levels in <i>Penguin Panic</i>, a charming retro-style platformer full of surprises, secret challenges, and slippery foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Penguin Adventure </i>on the MSX, <i>Penguin Panic</i> brings retro 2D platformer fun with modern polish. Whether you're bouncing off walrus heads, collecting tasty fish, or racing against the clock, every level is a colorful, fast-paced adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 hand-crafted levels across icy tundras, grassy fields, scorching deserts, and snowy peaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls, satisfying platforming, and loads of hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No violence, no ads\u2014just pure, penguin-powered fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for kids, nostalgic grownups, and anyone who says \u201cnoot noot\u201d unironically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by the award-winning creators of <i>Avalon</i> and <i>Online Soccer Manager (OSM)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to outwit the walruses and save your family? Slide into action and find out!</p>",
    "short_description": "The walruses stole your eggs. Time to get them back! Run, jump, and stomp your way through 17 vibrant levels in this fast-paced, family-friendly platformer. Battle bad guys, uncover secrets, and collect shiny fish\u2014all with simple controls and tons of charm. Pure penguin-powered fun for all ages!",
